@page
@model Portfolio.Pages.AboutModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Me";
}

<section class="about-hero">
    <div class="about-photo-wrapper">
        <div class="about-photo-placeholder">
            <i class="bi bi-person-fill"></i>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-intro">
        <h1 class="about-intro__title">About Me</h1>
        <p class="about-intro__subtitle">From hospitality to code — building a career around what I love.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="about-bio">
        <p>
        Before diving into code, I spent years working in the restaurant industry, an environment that
        taught me how to stay calm under pressure, work closely with a team, and keep quality high even
        when things get busy. I'd love to bring my development skills back to that world one day, but
        I'm genuinely open to wherever the opportunities take me.
    </p>
    <p>
        I've always been drawn to computers. What started as a hobby eventually became something I
        couldn't ignore, so I made the decision to turn it into a career and I am finally taking the steps I 
        need. Today I'm studying to become a .NET developer, which will help me expand my portfolio for the future.
    </p>
    <p>
        At my core, I'm a social and curious person — I genuinely enjoy meeting new people and hearing
        different perspectives, which is part of why the restaurant industry suited me so well. That same
        curiosity is what drives me in tech: I love digging into how things work, picking up new tools,
        and never settling for "good enough" when there's more to learn.
    </p>
    <p>
        I hold myself to high standards. I love pushing my own limits and constantly improving —
        whether that means shipping a new feature on a personal project or acing an exam. In school,
        I'm aiming for nothing less than top grades.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="about-highlights">
    <div class="about-highlight-card">
        <i class="bi bi-cup-hot-fill"></i>
        <p>Background in the restaurant industry, open to bringing tech there in the future</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-highlight-card">
        <i class="bi bi-cpu-fill"></i>
        <p>Lifelong interest in computers, now turned into a career</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-highlight-card">
        <i class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow"></i>
        <p>High ambitions — always working to develop myself further</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-highlight-card">
        <i class="bi bi-mortarboard-fill"></i>
        <p>Aiming for top grades, no compromises in school</p>
    </div>
</section>